CloudWatch Log Groups (3):
  /aws-devops-platform/app    : request + slow_request logs, 7 day retention
  /aws-devops-platform/errors : error logs, 7 day retention
  /aws-devops-platform/access : access logs per request, 7 day retention

Log Format: structured JSON
  Fields: type, requestId, path, durationMs, timestamp

Logs Insights Queries Run:
  1. Request count by path
  2. Slow requests over 200ms
  3. Error count
  4. Recent log tail

Metric Filter:
  error-count-filter on /aws-devops-platform/errors
  Pattern: { $.type = "error" }
  Metric: AppErrorCount in aws-devops-platform/app namespace

Files Created:
  scripts/log-aggregation/app/app.js
  scripts/log-aggregation/app/Dockerfile

